    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## So sánh với ngành — CDC Pipeline\n\n| Metric | **Pipeline này** | Debezium docs | Databricks RTM (2026) | Netflix (2025) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **E2E latency p50** | **2.02s** | ~ms (DB→Kafka only, không tính Spark) | <200ms (7× i3.2xlarge cloud) | seconds (analytics CDC) |\n| **E2E latency p99** | **4.05s** | N/A | <500ms | N/A |\n| **Throughput E2E** | **35 ev/s** | ~7,000 ev/s (connector max, single-threaded) | 100K+ ev/s | 100M ev/s (Data Mesh) |\n| **Redis p99 read** | **<1ms** | N/A | N/A | <100μs (near-cache) |\n| **Sync rate** | **100%** | at-least-once | exactly-once | exactly-once |\n| **Infra** | **1 laptop · Docker** | 2× EC2 c5a.xlarge | 7× i3.2xlarge | K8s · multi-DC · 10K+ engineers |\n\n### Key Insights\n- **Bottleneck = Spark trigger 2s**, không phải Kafka (experiment: partition 1→3 chỉ tăng +0.4%)\n- **Trigger 2s** được xác định bằng experiment: batch processing ~1200ms → min safe trigger = 1200 × 1.5 = 1800ms → 2s\n- **Redis <1ms** đạt industry standard — serving layer không phải bottleneck\n- **Debezium chỉ đo DB→Kafka (~ms)** — pipeline này đo full E2E bao gồm Spark batch window\n- Muốn <200ms cần Spark 4.x RTM hoặc Flink + cloud cluster"
      }
    },
